nces":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"1春，正月，楚王囂來朝。二月，乙亥，詔以囂素行純茂，特加顯異，封其子勳爲廣戚侯。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，楚王刘嚣到京师朝见天子。二月十六日乙亥，汉成帝下诏，因刘嚣一向品行端正、特别优秀，特加褒扬，封他的儿子刘勋为广戚侯。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，楚王嚣来朝。二月，乙亥，诏以嚣素行纯茂，特加显异，封其子勋为广戚侯。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2385,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91d0eb35-db0e-11ef-b151-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"犍爲","place_name_jianti_auto":"犍为","resolved_place_entity_id":825,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"91d0eb43-db0e-11ef-81a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江水","place_name_jianti_auto":"江水","resolved_place_entity_id":47,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"91d0eb44-db0e-11ef-9f7d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、叙州府（卷七十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"疑即此处。今为济渡处，亦曰锁江津，又东流入南溪县界。详见...","context_before":"...两岸有大石屹立，昔人置铁勍横绝其处，控扼蛮寇，名曰锁江。","source_end_index":106,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3f300d56-3df8-5e7b-8244-2dbc885e1083","source_start_index":85,"source_text":"《汉纪》：河平三年，犍为山崩，壅江水逆流。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/七、叙州府（卷七十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、眉州（卷七十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"亦曰盐塈，李冰所平也。《华阳国志》：青衣有沫水，触山胁为...","context_before":"...》：江水又东南径南安县西，有熊耳峡，连山竞险，接岭争高。","source_end_index":87,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"77a479c0-6b10-5156-b698-fe1255aaee5a","source_start_index":64,"source_text":"河平中，山崩地震，江水逆流，悬塈有滩，名垒坻。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/九、眉州（卷七十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2丙戌，犍爲地震，山崩，壅江水，水逆流。","content_fanyi":"二月二十七日丙戌，犍为郡发生地震，高山崩塌，堵塞了长江，江水倒流。","content_jianti_auto":"2丙戌，犍为地震，山崩，壅江水，水逆流。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2386,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"91d0eb41-db0e-11ef-9766-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3秋，八月，乙卯晦，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"秋季，八月二十九日乙卯晦，发生日食。","content_jianti_auto":"3秋，八月，乙卯晦，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2387,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"91d0eb45-db0e-11ef-ad0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91d17dd8-db0e-11ef-95e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"91d17dd9-db0e-11ef-9456-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉歆","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘歆","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"91d17dda-db0e-11ef-8965-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"延閣","place_name_jianti_auto":"延阁","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"91d17ddb-db0e-11ef-b592-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言中，以別外。藝文志曰：武帝建藏書之策。劉歆曰：外則有太常、太史、博士之藏，內則有延閣、廣內、祕室之府。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言中，以别外。艺文志曰：武帝建藏书之策。刘歆曰：外则有太常、太史、博士之藏，内则有延阁、广内、秘室之府。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"91d17dd7-db0e-11ef-98e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name"